config BR2_PACKAGE_THINGINO_SENSOR_INFO
	bool "thingino-sensor-info"
	help
	  Userspace Ingenic image sensor detector. Probes the sensor
	  I2C bus against a database of known sensors, driving MCLK
	  and reset/pwdn GPIOs itself. Replaces the sinfo kernel
	  module and the per-kernel .ko download flow.

	  https://github.com/thingino/sensor-info
